    "freeTraits": 0,
    "biography": "<h2>Background</h2><p>Raymond woke with no memory of his sire, clan, or true name, rescued by a mage calling himself Aaron Carson (in truth the Sons of Ether mage Martin D'Richet, whose daughter Marie was Embraced in New Orleans). Twice denied residency in the city for failing to prove a clan, Raymond let Carson's careful manipulation turn his humiliation into hatred of Prince Marcel. He now runs a mobile Kindred blood auction out of the docks, kidnapping refugee vampires as &ldquo;stock&rdquo; for elders desperate for potent vitae, still believing Carson's promise to one day reveal his forgotten past.</p><h2>Roleplaying Hints</h2><p>Friendly and businesslike as auctioneer, but tough and unforgiving if your instructions are not followed to the letter.</p><p><strong>Disciplines (as printed, dot-rating, converted to owned Discipline Items on this Actor at Storyteller discretion):</strong> Auspex 2, Celerity 1, Dominate 3, Fortitude 1, Potence 1, Presence 3, Thaumaturgy 3 (Lure of Flames 3, Movement of the Mind 2, Weather Control 1).</p>",
    "notes": "Sire: Unknown. Rituals: Summon Guardian Spirit, Suppression of the Undead Mind. Haven: none permanent; moves between warehouses and apartments. Secrets rating: C+.",
    "npcType": "vampire"
  },
